      "y": 458.75,
      "width": 292.5998840332031,
      "height": 87.5,
      "text": "status != PENDING → rollback agents\nRUNNING → flow = PLANNING\nWAITING → flow = EXECUTING\nupdate_status(RUNNING)\nplan = get_latest_plan(),  step = None",
